OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FStill quite a lot of cloud
OL,6,Fthrough the morning with patchy
OL,7,Fdrizzle, but more in the way of
OL,8,Fbrighter or sunnier spells expected in
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Winds remaining light.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLittle
OL,12,Fchange, rather cloudy through into
OL,13,Fnext week, with patchy drizzle or
OL,14,Fshowers. Where any cloud breaks occur,
OL,15,Fovernight fog and frost may develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
